{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49079","headline":"歌头 · 後唐庄宗","name":"歌头","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏芳春，暖风飘箔。\n莺啼绿树，轻烟笼晚阁。\n杏桃红，开繁萼。\n灵和殿，禁柳千行斜，金丝络。\n夏云多，奇峰如削，纨扇动微凉，轻绡薄。\n梅雨霁，火云烁。\n临水槛，永日逃繁暑，泛觥酌。\n露华浓，冷高梧。\n雕万叶，一霎晚风。\n蝉声新雨歇，惜惜此光阴，如流水，东篱菊残时，叹萧索。\n繁阴积，岁时暮。\n景难留，不觉朱颜失却。\n好容光，且且须呼宾友。\n西园长宵，讌云谣。\n歌皓齿，且行乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後唐庄宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}